{"3726670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Unplace", "steam_appid": 3726670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... I don’t know how I ended up here – maybe I just walked through the wrong door. But one thing I know for sure: this place shouldn’t exist. This is the Unplace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At first it seems empty: I walk through room after room, and nothing happens. And then - as if the system switches on. I tried to run, but it became clear every time: I won’t be let go that easily. <strong>This place has one rule: face the trials.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.poster.avif?t=1768319132\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.webm?t=1768319132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.mp4?t=1768319132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an otherworldly place - the Unplace.<br>It wants to play with you in many different ways, even if the price of the game is your life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the nature of each trial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some challenges test your reflexes, others your focus, and others still your dexterity and nerves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake costs you the entire path</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creeping, ever-building sense of tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of unique and demanding challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that loops back on itself – unpredictable and constantly shifting</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>... I don’t know how I ended up here – maybe I just walked through the wrong door. But one thing I know for sure: this place shouldn’t exist. This is the Unplace.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>At first it seems empty: I walk through room after room, and nothing happens. And then - as if the system switches on. I tried to run, but it became clear every time: I won’t be let go that easily. <strong>This place has one rule: face the trials.</strong></i></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" > <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.poster.avif?t=1768319132\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.webm?t=1768319132\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/extras/dc904a64fbda37219d280d5b87607c6b.mp4?t=1768319132\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are trapped in an otherworldly place - the Unplace.<br>It wants to play with you in many different ways, even if the price of the game is your life.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay sharp</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Uncover the nature of each trial</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some challenges test your reflexes, others your focus, and others still your dexterity and nerves</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every mistake costs you the entire path</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong>:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A creeping, ever-building sense of tension</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A wide range of unique and demanding challenges</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A world that loops back on itself – unpredictable and constantly shifting</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "“The Unplace: Escaping The Cursed Place by Facing Different Trials” is a first-person game where you must escape a cursed place by completing a series of trials.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Russian<strong>*</strong>, German<strong>*</strong>, Japanese<strong>*</strong>, Simplified Chinese<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/9df9ffc6f01435d5ec99dfdd5eb19c5bd0bc3d2d/header.jpg?t=1768319132", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/3d0ac57e7ef22adf5c05bf31ceb52fb33aa7add7/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768319132", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3726670/3d0ac57e7ef22adf5c05bf31ceb52fb33aa7add7/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768319132", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 64bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> intel Core i7 4770<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 512 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 970<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong